@startuml
title Stage skills and the records they add
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
[tspec-explore] as E
[tspec-refine-feature] as RF
[tspec-new-change] as NC
[tspec-refine-change] as RC
[tspec-apply-change] as AP
[tspec-archive] as AR

E --> RF : feature sketch
RF --> NC : product and component requirements
NC --> RC : one proposed change
RC --> AP : software requirements and design
AP --> AR : verified change
@enduml
